-“Pics dls Vidals i Tort i Estanys Gento, Colomina, Frescau, Mar, Saburó, Carboneres, Morto, Castieso, Eixerola, Mariolo i Tort” 
es.wikiloc.com/rutas-alpinismo/pics-dls-vidals-i-tort-i-estanys-gento-colomina-frescau-mar-saburo-carboneres-morto-castieso-eixero-40426620 
 
-“Olla de Filià Integral: Pics de Fitero, Filià (o Paiasso) i Llena (o Tres Pessons) i Tossals de Tres Muntanyes, Calma i Costa” 
ca.wikiloc.com/rutes-alpinisme/olla-de-filia-integral-pics-de-fitero-filia-o-paiasso-i-llena-o-tres-pessons-i-tossals-de-tres-munt-186809675', '{"en":"This scenic loop starts in the picturesque village of Castell-estaó, in Vall Fosca. The initial section follows a well-maintained old path through oak trees and pastures to Antist, where you can visit the church and refresh at the fountain.\n\nThe ascent to Santa Bàrbara mountain (1612m) begins from Antist, climbing the panoramic Serrat d’Eirola. Despite its modest height, the summit offers excellent views. The route continues to the Hermitage of Santa Bàrbara before descending via Serrat de l’Aire, providing continuous vistas of neighboring villages and mountains back to Castell-estaó. The entire 9 km route with 533m elevation gain is well-marked and clear.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular panoràmica comença al pintoresc poble de Castell-estaó, a la Vall Fosca. El tram inicial segueix un antic camí ben arranjat entre roures i pastures fins a Antist, on es pot visitar l''església i refrescar-se a la font.\n\nLa pujada a la Muntanya de Santa Bàrbara (1612m) s''inicia des d''Antist, remuntant el panoràmic Serrat d’Eirola. Malgrat la seva modesta alçada, el cim ofereix unes vistes excel·lents. La ruta continua fins a l''Ermita de Santa Bàrbara abans de davallar pel Serrat de l’Aire, amb vistes constants dels pobles i muntanyes veïnes de tornada a Castell-estaó. Tot el recorregut de 9 km i 533m de desnivell està perfectament senyalitzat i net.","es":"Esta ruta circular panorámica comienza en el pintoresco pueblo de Castell-estaó, en la Vall Fosca. El tramo inicial sigue un antiguo camino bien cuidado entre robles y pastos hasta Antist, donde se puede visitar la iglesia y refrescarse en la fuente.\n\nEl ascenso a la Montaña de Santa Bàrbara (1612m) se inicia desde Antist, subiendo por el panorámico Serrat d’Eirola. A pesar de su modesta altura, la cima ofrece excelentes vistas. La ruta continúa hasta la Ermita de Santa Bàrbara antes de descender por el Serrat de l’Aire, con vistas continuas de los pueblos y montañas vecinas de regreso a Castell-estaó. Todo el recorrido de 9 km y 533m de desnivel está perfectamente señalizado y limpio."}'::jsonb, 'Aventura''t', 9045, 533, 533, 1608, 1103, 'easy', 'loop', NULL, 21060, 858, '2022-08-14', '2022-05', '[{"lat":42.38748,"lng":0.953219,"ele":1121.2},{"lat":42.38748,"lng":0.953217,"ele":1121.2},{"lat":42.387455,"lng":0.953223,"ele":1121.1},{"lat":42.387388,"lng":0.953363,"ele":1121.7},{"lat":42.387295,"lng":0.953715,"ele":1122},{"lat":42.38723,"lng":0.953816,"ele":1120.1},{"lat":42.387178,"lng":0.953908,"ele":1118.5},{"lat":42.387095,"lng":0.954099,"ele":1114.5},{"lat":42.387037,"lng":0.954148,"ele":1111.5},{"lat":42.387035,"lng":0.95415,"ele":1111.4},{"lat":42.387021,"lng":0.954227,"ele":1110.8},{"lat":42.38697,"lng":0.954294,"ele":1109},{"lat":42.386964,"lng":0.954307,"ele":1108.8},{"lat":42.386959,"lng":0.954325,"ele":1108.7},{"lat":42.386937,"lng":0.954388,"ele":1108.3},{"lat":42.386944,"lng":0.954577,"ele":1108},{"lat":42.386946,"lng":0.954586,"ele":1108},{"lat":42.386977,"lng":0.954631,"ele":1108.5},{"lat":42.387017,"lng":0.954667,"ele":1109.2},{"lat":42.387054,"lng":0.95481,"ele":1106.7},{"lat":42.387065,"lng":0.954853,"ele":1105.5},{"lat":42.387086,"lng":0.954922,"ele":1103.6},{"lat":42.387109,"lng":0.954929,"ele":1103.6},{"lat":42.387109,"lng":0.954925,"ele":1103.7},{"lat":42.387112,"lng":0.954914,"ele":1104.1},{"lat":42.387077,"lng":0.95493,"ele":1103.2},{"lat":42.387081,"lng":0.954918,"ele":1103.6},{"lat":42.387079,"lng":0.954906,"ele":1104},{"lat":42.387075,"lng":0.954916,"ele":1103.6},{"lat":42.387052,"lng":0.954759,"ele":1108.2},{"lat":42.387026,"lng":0.95465,"ele":1109.6},{"lat":42.386982,"lng":0.954619,"ele":1108.8},{"lat":42.386955,"lng":0.954583,"ele":1108.3},{"lat":42.386952,"lng":0.954516,"ele":1108.7},{"lat":42.38695,"lng":0.954432,"ele":1109.1},{"lat":42.386948,"lng":0.954386,"ele":1108.7},{"lat":42.386968,"lng":0.954318,"el