('wikiloc', '112943089', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/presa-cavallers-bretxa-harle-punta-harle-refugi-ventosa-i-calvell-112943089', 'Cavallers Dam - Harlé Breach - Punta Harlé - Ventosa i Calvell Refuge', '{"en":"One way via Harlé Breach","ca":"Un sol sentit per Bretxa Harlé","es":"Un solo sentido por Brecha Harlé"}'::jsonb, 'Presa Cavallers-Bretxa Harlé-Punta Harlé-Refugi Ventosa i Calvell Hiking trail in Boí, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. La pulada des de la Bretxa Harlé fins al cim s''ha de grimpar ,després hi ha algún tram Que el senderò es perd,però seguin el trac no hi ha problema.', '{"en":"This difficult one-way route starts at Cavallers Dam and heads towards Punta d''Harlé, with a significant elevation gain over a shorter distance. The most challenging section is the climb from Bretxa Harlé to the summit, which requires scrambling.\n\nBeyond Bretxa Harlé, the path can be difficult to follow in places, making a GPS track essential for navigation. The route concludes at Refugi Ventosa i Calvell, making it suitable for a multi-day trek or requiring logistical planning for return transport.","ca":"Aquesta difícil ruta d''anada comença a la Presa de Cavallers i es dirigeix cap a la Punta d''Harlé, amb un desnivell significatiu en una distància més curta. La secció més desafiadora és la pujada des de la Bretxa Harlé fins al cim, que requereix grimpades.\n\nMés enllà de la Bretxa Harlé, el sender pot perdre''s en alguns trams, fent imprescindible seguir el track GPS. La ruta conclou al Refugi Ventosa i Calvell, sent adequada per a una travessa de diversos dies o requerint planificació logística per al transport de tornada.","es":"Esta difícil ruta de ida comienza en la Presa de Cavallers y se dirige hacia Punta d''Harlé, con un desnivel significativo en una distancia más corta. La sección más desafiante es la subida desde la Bretxa Harlé hasta la cima, que requiere trepadas.\n\nMás allá de la Bretxa Harlé, el sendero puede perderse en algunos tramos, haciendo imprescindible seguir el track GPS. La ruta concluye en el Refugio Ventosa i Calvell, siendo adecuada para una travesía de varios días o requiriendo planificación logística para el transporte de vuelta."}'::jsonb, 'joan53', 12682, 1520, 1042, 2871, 1733, 'difficult', 'one-way', 27960, 35760, 2385, '2022-09-06', '2022-08', '[{"lat":42.584585,"lng":0.855079,"ele":1733.7},{"lat":42.584639,"lng":0.855075,"ele":1734.4},{"lat":42.584607,"lng":0.85512,"ele":1734.9},{"lat":42.584561,"lng":0.855133,"ele":1734.6},{"lat":42.584533,"lng":0.855183,"ele":1735.2},{"lat":42.584484,"lng":0.855175,"ele":1734.3},{"lat":42.584433,"lng":0.855159,"ele":1733.5},{"lat":42.584373,"lng":0.855163,"ele":1733.9},{"lat":42.584325,"lng":0.855183,"ele":1734.8},{"lat":42.584274,"lng":0.855156,"ele":1734.2},{"lat":42.584233,"lng":0.855122,"ele":1733.1},{"lat":42.584195,"lng":0.855171,"ele":1735.2},{"lat":42.584199,"lng":0.855233,"ele":1737.7},{"lat":42.584218,"lng":0.855294,"ele":1740},{"lat":42.584247,"lng":0.855359,"ele":1742.5},{"lat":42.584281,"lng":0.855407,"ele":1743.9},{"lat":42.584316,"lng":0.855455,"ele":1745.1},{"lat":42.584362,"lng":0.855467,"ele":1744.3},{"lat":42.584409,"lng":0.855481,"ele":1743.6},{"lat":42.584455,"lng":0.855475,"ele":1742.8},{"lat":42.584466,"lng":0.855544,"ele":1745.6},{"lat":42.584512,"lng":0.855539,"ele":1747.5},{"lat":42.584522,"lng":0.855604,"ele":1750.9},{"lat":42.584475,"lng":0.855621,"ele":1749.4},{"lat":42.584424,"lng":0.855616,"ele":1748.3},{"lat":42.584395,"lng":0.855663,"ele":1751.2},{"lat":42.584351,"lng":0.855648,"ele":1751.9},{"lat":42.584317,"lng":0.855599,"ele":1750.9},{"lat":42.584271,"lng":0.855576,"ele":1751.5},{"lat":42.584222,"lng":0.855584,"ele":1753.4},{"lat":42.584172,"lng":0.855612,"ele":1756.1},{"lat":42.58413,"lng":0.855653,"ele":1758.5},{"lat":42.584085,"lng":0.855668,"ele":1759.9},{"lat":42.584109,"lng":0.85572,"ele":1761.6},{"lat":42.584154,"lng":0.855699,"ele":1759.9},{"lat":42.58418